<title>UK: Finnish Export Credit sets 100 million stg bond.</title>
<headline>Finnish Export Credit sets 100 million stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.75 PCT  MATURITY    29.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.758   PAY DATE    25.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.626 PCT REOFFER    99.358    SPREAD	+11.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/FI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
